{"title":"Ser Aldric the Hollow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Ser Aldric the Hollow is a named <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> seen at level 45.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Ser Aldric the Hollow</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1450, 1104</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"ser-aldric-the-hollow\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/47101fc28bf0320da498.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/540c73fa0d52fe472906.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Ser Aldric the Hollow</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>45</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>729</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}